WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.364
Distinct distances, every dimension.

2
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.387
A grid of points repeats its distances a

3
00:00:05.387 --> 00:00:07.475
lot. Can any arrangement repeat them more?

4
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:13.722
Equal distances become crossing flats, and polynomials limit how many can cross.

5
00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:16.716
Claimed: grids are best, up to a constant.

6
00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:19.498
Manuscript only, no Lean.
